<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n45655" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐφελκ-υστικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>,
			<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>drawing on, attractive</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τᾶς ψυχᾶς</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Hippod.
				</span></i>
			 ap. <i><span class="en">
				Stob.
				4.1.94
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ε̄ . . γίνεται ἐ. τοῦ ν̄</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Choerob.
					<u>in Theod.</u>
					2.38
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				<u>EM</u>
				431.22
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Eust.
				52.22
			</span></i>. Adv. -<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κῶς</span> Sch.<i><span class="en">
				Luc.
				<u>VH</u>
				2.25
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b> in later
			Gramm., 
				Pass.
			, <i>attracted, suffixed</i>, 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ ν̄ ἐφελκυστικὸν γίνεται</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					<u>EM</u>
					438.50
				</span></i>
			, cf. Sch.D.T.<i><span class="en">
				p.465
			</span></i> H.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
